    "description": "What: the DRAGON flies and lands like a helicopter (CE-4634 D-1, docs/designs/fun/DESIGN_Dragon.md DR-1). On basic-desert a 'Dragon' (TKB 411, a rotorcraft on four legs) starts on the ground at (300, 300) and flies the 'Dragon route': up and east to (420, 300) at 25 m, down onto a meadow at (500, 350) where it LANDS and holds 8 s, then up again to (620, 300) at 30 m. Judge: it lifts off; it lands within 8 m of the meadow (on its legs, no longer airborne); it takes off again after the landing; it reaches the last point."
